window.products.push({"id":259048,"name":"LUCKYBOY Reversible Recliner SlipCover for Pet Dog Kid,Anti-Slip & Stain Resistant Furniture Protector Cover, Machine Washable(Smoky Gray/Light Gray, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EjMhZ+o5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☞ Specification High quality quilted texture,anti-slip foams to prevent sliding Reversible,one-piece sofa cover,double sided use Giving your furniture two gorgeous looks while protect your sofa from daily stains ☞ Product Dimensions Chair Cover: Height 76'', Width 65''. includes 22'' on each side for armrest. Total sitting area is 21'' Loveseat Cover: Height 74'', Width 90''. includes 22'' on each side for armrest. Total sitting area is 46'' Sofa Cover: Height 76'', Width 112''. includes 22'' on each side for armrest. Total sitting area is 68'' Recliner Cover: Height 91'', Width 84'', includes 27'' on each side for armrest. Total sitting area is 30'' Sofa Cover(Oversize): Height 86'', Width 132''. includes 27'' on each side for armrest. Total sitting area is 78'' Futon Cover: 70'' x 76 '' *Please see the measure guide on the photos. If you have a sectional sofa or sofa sets, you may need 2 or more pieces of the covers. ☞ Newest Design to Make Protector Stay in Place CALA LIFE Sofa covers feature the newest design which have both two loops on the front and back of the sofa cover and four straps. ☞ There are two ways to use it: *1.FASTEN PROTECTOR FROM FRONT TO BACK* Tie strap through front loop-Go through under seat-Tie strap through back loop.(Refer to the picture above) *2.FASTEN THE FOUR SIDES* The front and back four loops of the sofa cover are bundled with the four footrests of the sofa. ☞ Note: Minor adjustments will be needed with rowdy dogs and kids ☞ NOTE It’s not 100% waterproof! Spills should be removed immediately. Sofa cover can be washed by machine or hand. Be careful to do it at low temperatures, using a mild detergent powder. Don’t ironing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EjMhZ+o5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUCKYBOY","source_asin":"B07TFF3J1S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259048","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TFF3J1S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TFF3J1S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":259049,"name":"Small 2-screw Replacement Handle for Vintage Revere Ware Pans","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/119pTS+ewDL._AC_.jpg","description":"PLEASE DO NOT ORDER THIS HANDLE SIZE UNLESS YOU ARE SURE IT WILL FIT YOUR PAN! SEE THE MEASUREMENTS BELOW (ESPECIALLY THE SPLINE SIZE). THIS SIZE FITS VERY FEW PAN SIZES.  These are small sized replacement handles for vintage era Revere Ware pans. These parts are newly manufactured are made to look and work just like original Revere Ware handles.They will ONLY fit the very smallest of pans.   Includes: Two handle halves (Bakelite) + hardware set (stainless steel)  Measurements: 4.5 in (115 mm) long, 2.75 in (70 mm) between holes on center  Fits: Vintage era 6 in skillets, and possibly others. These fit Revere Ware pans with handles that have two screws through the Bakelite. THESE FIT A LIMITED NUMBER OF PANS/SKILLETS and fit a 3/8 in metal spline that is smaller than the 5/8 (medium handle) or 3/4 in spline (large, x-large) most Revere Ware skillets and pans have. Please make sure your pan has the smaller spline these handles are made for.  Hardware Notes  The screws in the hardware set are Phillips head, not slotted like the original Revere Ware screw sets were. Because the original slot head screws strip very easily, we consider this an improvement.  Bakelite Notes  Bakelite is a great heat resistant material, but it can be a bit brittle. The most important thing is to not over tighten the screws when assembling the pan handle or you can crack the handle. These parts are not oven-save. Washing in a dishwasher may dull the finish over time.  Installation Notes  We have seen about 5% of handles where the screw holes are off just enough to make it very hard to get the nuts to go all the way through. This is just a natural variation in the original Revere manufacturing process. A slight widening of the holes on the metal spline will allow the handles to fit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/119pTS+ewDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RevereWareParts.com","source_asin":"B004LULRNO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004LULRNO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004LULRNO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
