window.products.push({"id":259075,"name":"Large Beverage Ice Tub for Parties and Weddings – Hammered Copper Wine Chiller Bucket with Stainless Steel Handles – Rustic Farmhouse Drink Cooler for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pG9802oPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cook out and chill This beautiful copper drink cooler for parties puts all your favorite canned and bottled beverages at guests' fingertips with more style and chilling power than other party tub alternatives. Boasting an eye-catching hammered texture that enhances its visual appeal, the Riches & Lee Beverage Tub transforms any gathering into a special occasion. Its country charm also makes it a tasteful complement to your rustic wedding decorations or farmhouse kitchen decor. Large and long-lasting Our decorative ice cooler and drink bucket has been handmade by artisans from a single piece of 100% pure copper so it is seamless and leakproof. With 2 sturdy stainless steel handles for portability, it goes from outdoor patio cooler to tabletop ice tub in seconds. Because copper transfers the cold more efficiently than other metal drink buckets, ice melts more slowly so bottled and canned beverages stay frosty-cold longer. Its large size also means that it will need less frequent refilling. An indispensable bar gift As stylish and convenient as the Riches & Lee Party Bucket for drinks is in your own home, it also makes a thoughtful and impressive addition to friends' bar accessories and decor. Tastefully packaged and ready to bestow as a wedding or housewarming gift, this hammered copper beverage chiller and wine cooler bucket will be much appreciated by its recipients every time their guests offer glowing compliments. Give guests stylish access to their favorite party beverages. Add our Hammered Copper Wine and Beer Cooler to your home bar accessories and decor today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pG9802oPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Riches & Lee","source_asin":"B083QPX7V7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259075","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083QPX7V7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083QPX7V7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":259076,"name":"Fruit and Vegetable Washing Machine, Portable Fruit Cleaning Device with OH-ion Purification Technology, Wireless Rechargeable Food Purifier Cleaner D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AUvujKBYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅HYDROXY WATER ION PURIFICATION TECHNOLOGY - Our fruit and vegetable use water as raw material to achieve high-efficiency purification in three steps: ① Electrolysis (water is decomposed into OH- and H+ under the action of electrolytic material.) ② Degradation (OH- will destroy chemical molecule of residual and cell walls, make it becomes harmless.) ③ Deep Purification (OH- and Cl combine into HClO, will deeply degrade residues and harmful ingredient.) ✅WITH TWO MODES - The fruit and vegetable cleaning machine has two purification modes, press the switch once to enter the fast purification mode for 10 minutes, and press twice to enter the deep purification mode for 15 minutes. You can choose the corresponding purification mode according to your needs. NOTE: The top cover can be removed for deep cleaning after each use. ✅WIRELESS DESIGN - With wireless charging base, saying goodbye to the cumbersome wired charging. And the fruit cleaner builted-in 2600mAh high capacity rechargeable battery, the fruit and vegetable purifier can be used for 10-15 times when fully charged. No direct contact with strong electricity, safe and stable. ✅PORTABLE & COMPACT - The Vegetable and Fruit Cleaning Machine is portable and compact, can be easily placed in your bag. It is not only suitable for home kitchen use, but also ideal for business trips or camping, outdoor travel. ✅WIDE APPLICATIONS - The fruit and vegetable washing machine has a wide range of uses, can be used for fruits and vegetables, seafood, grains, tableware, meat, kitchen utensils, etc. The fruit cleaner help your family get rid of the tedious work of cleaning food, save time and harvest health, making them the perfect gifts for your wife, mother and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AUvujKBYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAMOPY","source_asin":"B0BDFK45RQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259076","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDFK45RQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDFK45RQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
