window.products.push({"id":259095,"name":"Yifely Old Fashion Newspaper Furniture Protective Paper Roll Peel Stick Shelf Drawer Liner Locker Sticker 17.7 Inch by 13 Ft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tTU36UGJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Instruction For Use:1. It can be placed on any smooth clean and dry surface like shelf, board, wood cabinet,drawer,walls,window,glass and so on. It is best applied at room temperature.2. Sand down rough surfaces prior to sticking. Clean large surfaces with mild soap and water.3. Measure the surface to cover. Cut the film into right size, leaving about 5cm extra overlap on all edges is beter.4. Peel off the backing paper evenly with one hand whilst smoothing the film to the surface. With your other hand, from the center to edges. For this it's better to use a soft cloth.5. Creases and air bubbles can be removed by applying light pressure from the center to the edges. Pierce stubborn bubbles with a needle and squeeze the air out.This multi-purpose drawer paper can protect the furniture from humidity and dirt efficiently.A adorable furniture accessories for your daily home life.Wide:45cmLength: 4MPlease allow 3~7cm deviation as they are manual cutting. If you buy more than two items, we may package your order into ONE ROLL with the toal length you ordered together in one parcel. But our other warehouse in England will send seperated roll. Please be noted.Material: PVCPackage Included: One RollNote:1.Color tones can vary due to lighting in the room, pictures on wall for reference only.2.Buy enough rolls at a time to make sure they come from the same batch to avoid color difference.3. Wallpaper you will receive may have some wrinkles on it or both ends, but it do not effect looking after use on dry flat surface.4. Storage methods: stored at cool, dry and ventilated place. Because of PVC material, you can put it in a ventilated place to remove the vinyl smell.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tTU36UGJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yifely","source_asin":"B01LVV4LV0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LVV4LV0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LVV4LV0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":259096,"name":"VEVOR Stainless Steel Oyster Shucker Tool Set, Clam Opener Machine with G-Clip for Easy Operation, Solid Option for Hotel Buffets or Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J04XgvgiL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stainless Steel Material: Our oyster shucker machine is made of excellent stainless steel to enhance the wear resistance. 304 stainless steel is used in the cutter head, which is more firm and sharp, ensuring that the oyster can be opened accurately in the shelling process. Adjustable Position: The 3.5-inch adjustable height of the oyster shucker machine is more practical. It allows you to shell oysters of different sizes, large, medium, and small, to solve your multiple needs at one time. Excellent Design: G-clip provide sufficient stability to avoid the oyster shucker slip during operation. 4 grooves on the stainless steel base help stabilize the oyster. The 18.3-inch extended handle adopts ergonomic design, comfortable to the touch and labor-saving. More importantly, you don’t have to worry about cutting your hands during the operation. Convenient To Operate: Our oyster opener tool is very convenient to use. Fix the oyster in the groove of the base, adjust the cutter head to the gap in the middle of the oyster shell. Then press the handle evenly, you can easily separate the shell and get intact meat. Extensive Application: Our shelling machine can not only help you deal with oysters quickly and efficiently but also shelling clams, scallops, and other shell ingredients. It's an excellent tool for restaurants, seafood markets, hotels, buffets, and families.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J04XgvgiL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEVOR","source_asin":"B099ZL6B8T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099ZL6B8T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099ZL6B8T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
