window.products.push({"id":259126,"name":"Kate Aspen \"Around The World Map Favor Gift Box, Wedding/Party Decorations, Set of 24","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mzt8wAvjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A gift of thanks for almost any occasion on earth! As unique a favor box as you'll find in all the world, with a universal appeal that makes life-and your special occasion-oh, so sweet! Travel-inspiring favor box with map-print cover and vintage, Kraft slide-drawer, all tied with a double, natural-twine bow. Favor box measures 2 1/2\" h x 3\" w. Favor box measures 2 1/2\" h x 3\" w. Sold in sets of 24.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91mzt8wAvjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kate Aspen","source_asin":"B00HWS1Y8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HWS1Y8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HWS1Y8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":259127,"name":"NatureMill Ultra Compost Bin, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tZs4-OCpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Nature Mill Ultra Compost Bin is a great choice for being with its 4-gallon weekly capacity, superior durability, and minimalist style. The Ultra, made from 100% stainless steel internal components, works automatically indoors or outdoors, resulting in a mild earthy aroma that won't stink up the house. The two-chamber design couldn't be simpler - just add food to the upper chamber and remove compost every two weeks from the lower chamber. The bin, with a capacity of 4 gallons (15 liters), handles a typical family of four or five. Plus, it operates at only 47 decibels for noninvasive use. Dimensions: 24L x 24W x 29H inches. About NatureMill From activists to engineers, the people of NatureMill have aimed to make a difference. They recycle paper, bottles, and cans, read newspapers online, and favor products and packaging. Some even walk or bike to work. Despite their commitment to reduce, reuse, recycle, they still found themselves producing shameful amounts of trash. This was when they ventured head first into backyard composting, first with a humble kitchen crock. They soon discovered, after forgetting to clean their crock, that the waste was warm. Microorganisms were hard at work. The compost process had begun. Just a little more oxygen, some mechanical mixing, and a strong air filter would accelerate the process and eliminate the odors and bugs. Dozens of patents and prototypes later, the NatureMill was born. Compost in 2 weeks!. Steel exterior. Capacity: 4 gallons/15 liters. Automatic mixing for indoor/outdoor use. Choose from multiple color options. Includes 1-year warranty with lifetime guarantee on filter. Dimensions: 20L x 12W x 20H inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tZs4-OCpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NatureMill Ultra","source_asin":"B0082A9N6W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0082A9N6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0082A9N6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
