window.products.push({"id":259178,"name":"Sous Vide Cooker, Wifi Sous Vide Mchine Precision Cooker,IPX7 Waterproof, 1100W Fast-Heating Precision Immersion Circulator with Recipes on APP,Accura","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jTzh3vvML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"➤【2.4GHz Wifi Sous Vide Cooker】The sous vide cooker supports connecting with 2.4Ghz WIFI. Download the APP to observe, adjust and control the cooker anytime, anywhere. There are also a large number of recipes in the APP, you can choose the corresponding recipe for your food, automatically set the temperature and time, and free your hands with Miaton WIFI sous vide cooking cooker immersion circulator, stay up-to-date on your cooking status without being in the kitchen ➤【1100W Ultra-Quiet Fast Heating】This sous vide cooker realizes 1100W ultra-fast water heating. It adopts an ultra-quiet design, below 20 dB within 1 meter, and efficiently transfers heat through a 360° water circulation system. The constant temperature prevents the fiber of the ingredients from being destroyed and easily achieves the high-quality cooking effect of the Michelin restaurant level. you can cook fish, vegetables, eggs, meat, beef, lamb, pork, and more. ➤【Safe Materials & IPX7 Waterproof Design】Our sous vide precision cooker is made of food grade plastic and SUS304 stainless steel, which are sturdy, and resistant to high temperatures, which is safe to use. Ergonomic design size, can be operated with one hand. The sous vide has IPX7 waterproof certificationThe whole machine can be washed in water, and the removable stainless steel sleeve allows deep cleaning of stains in every crevice. ➤【Precision Temperature and Timer】This sous vide immersion circulators use a large LCD display, with a clear display, high touch sensitivity, and simple operation. The Sous Vide Cooker Equipped with overheating protection system, this thermal cooker will stop working and alarm you when the water level is lower than the minimum. Also will alarm you when temp reaches target setting value, So you can use it with confidence and never worry about what you might miss ➤【Precise & Powerful Cooker】With a 1100w super power motor and high-precision control chip, sous vide ensures rapid heating, accurate temperature control, and high-quality cooking results. The sous vide cooker supports timer (Timer Max:100 Hours ) and temperature settings ( Temperature range: 50℉~194℉(10℃~90℃) ). Precisely set the water to a preferred temperature, because this preset cooking method ensures perfect results. High temperature accuracy: 1℉/0.1℃ ➤【100% Quality Assurance】This sous vide cooking method has obtained the \"CE, FC, ROSH, PSE\" certification, and has also passed the withstand voltage test. Plus, all customers who purchase our sous vide precision Induction Cooker are covered by a 2-year warranty and lifetime maintenance","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jTzh3vvML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Miaton","source_asin":"B0BXNZMM24","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259178","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXNZMM24","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXNZMM24","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
