window.products.push({"id":259205,"name":"Large Cooler Bag Insulated with Two Reusable ice Pack, Big Lunch Box for Men Women Adult, Tactical Lunch Cooler Tote Bag for Work Travel, Black 28-Can","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UZD7P1piL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Larger Capacity - Its overall dimensions are: 12.6\" x 10.2\" x 10.2\", inside dimensions are: 11.02\" x 8.66\" x 8.27\". Spacious, up to 18L, easily fit for food, snacks, drinks, fruit, or vegetable for your healthy lunch. Designed with 1 large front zippered pocket and 1 side mesh pocket, the lunch cooler provides a large space to pack cellphone, keys, napkins, bottles, and other accessories when you go out.A velcro in the front pocket area can patch different patches you like. Safe and Portable - Reusable lunch bag adopts the 1000D polyester durable fabric and 100% leakproof PEVA insulated lining.If sauce spills inside, just wipe it off with wet cloth or napkins. Premium composite waterproof fabric is resistant to dirty and abrasion, protecting your lunch and items inside from occasional splatters or light rain.Come with a 51-inch-long adjustable detachable shoulder strap and reinforced grab handle, free your hands while you’re on the go. Durable and Practical - All stress points are sew reinforced and built to last; smooth and durable zipper and excellent workmanship, worry-free for falling off and tearing easily with rough use. 3 Ways Easy Carrying, adjustable detachable shoulder strap designed for your comfortable and convenient carrying for reusable and multi-occasion use. THIS ITEM IS NOT INTENDED FOR USE BY CHILDREN 12 AND UNDER. Excellent Long-term Insulation - Our tactical lunch box insulated with 4 layers 8mm thick EPE foam liner helps retain hot and cold temperatures up 7-8 hours to maintain freshness and taste of your food, truly keep your meal healthy.We're giving away two 300ml reusable ice packs to keep drinks cool. Multifunctional Military MOLLE Webbing - This tactical lunch bag in with 3 sides Molle webbing belt loops, can easily connect storage bags, keys, carabiner, sunglasses, etc.The rear molle belt also allows it to be attached to your larger backpack.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UZD7P1piL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ÖSSZEFUT","source_asin":"B0B2P6KQ1W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2P6KQ1W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2P6KQ1W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
