window.products.push({"id":259222,"name":"Shoe Box Organizer, Clear Flodable Shoe Storage Box with Lids Drop Front Sneaker Cases for Men Stackable Shoe Container Organizer for Entryway Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-FXkzd50L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Item Dimensions, Great Space Saver】S-JIANG shoe box organizer is a great for organizing your shoe collection and maximizing storage space.With over 13 inches length, 9 inches wide and 5.5 inches tall,the box provides enough space for almost all shoe types. It can hold up to a men’s size (12)/women’s size(12). These shoe storage boxes are big enough to accommodate most shoes without squishing or damaging its shape, it’s ideal for flat shoes but also fits other styles depending on their size. 【Drop-Front Door Provides Rapid Access】Compared to normal shoe boxes that have a top lid, the drop-front lid gives you easy access and you can take out your shoes without removing the box from the stack.It comes with a big air hole on the drop-front door which functions as a handle, so you can easily put your finger in it and pull down the door to open the box. The see-through front cover helps you to see what shoes you have available, so it easy for you to take out and put away shoes! 【No More Messy Closets With Scattered Shoes】Have you been upset about the scattered shoes in your closets? Then, our sneaker storage box is a perfect choice for you.It's an easy way to keep your shoe collection protected from dust while keeping them organized. They can easily be stack up in your closet to avoid cluttering the floor with scattered shoes. The flatness of the box makes them easy to fit under beds, on the shoe rack, in the bathroom, and all kinds of other place. 【Superior Quality, Wide Application】Our shoe storage box is made of high-quality polypropylene and premium ABS plastic which does not release toxic substances even in high temperature or humid environment.They are sturdy once put together and strong enough to be picked up and moved when fully loaded. The usage isn’t limited to footwear, they can also be used to store other items when they are not used by shoes, you can use them to categorize clothing, books, and anything else you might think of. 【Easy to assemble, Satisfaction Guarantee】Unlike some of the other containers, our shoe containers are easier to assemble. It can be fold into a box, but can also be unfolded and compressed to be put away when they are not storing footwear. The ventilation holes of the box allow air to flow throughout,preventing smells from lingering. We stand behind our products and want to ensure that you love them just as much as we do. If you ever have any issues with them, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-FXkzd50L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"S-JIANG","source_asin":"B08L4YQ4C1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259222","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L4YQ4C1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L4YQ4C1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
