window.products.push({"id":259266,"name":"Butter Bell - The Original Butter Bell crock by L Tremain, a Countertop French Ceramic Butter Dish Keeper for Spreadable Butter, Le Bistro, White with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317x+We8+6L._AC_.jpg","description":"INSPIRED BY PARISIAN BISTRO PATTERN – In the classic tradition of dinnerware found in Parisian bistros and brasseries, the Le Bistro Butter Bell crock is glazed in a creamy off-white color with hand painted French royal blue banding around the edges and bottom of the crock. Simple, yet elegant! DURABLE HIGH-QUALITY CERAMICS – The Butter Bell crocks are made from new bone china, a high grade, durable ceramic mixture. Liquid new bone china clay is poured into pre-cast plaster molds, then allowed to set for several hours. When dry, the butter bells are carefully removed from their molds, glazed and fired at 2200 degrees to create a beautiful, scratch resistant finish. Dishwasher safe; crocks contain NO lead or cadmium. Each purchase is back by a limited 2 year warranty EASY TO USE FOR ALL TYPES OF BUTTER – Pour cold water into the base, pack dry lid firmly with softened butter, add 1/3 cup of cold water to the base, then replace lid into the base. An airtight seal protects and preserves butter’s flavor and freshness. Easily fits one stick or cube (1/2 cup or 125 grams) of your favorite butter brand, or your own homemade butter STYLISH AND PRACTICAL – Conveniently sized crock hold one stick or cube of butter and fits neatly on your countertop as a perfect accent to any kitchen or tabletop décor, and is the perfect gift for all occasions for that foodie in your life THE ORIGINAL AND BEST– Modeled after the original French beurrier, the Butter Bell crock by L. Tremain keeps butter fresh and spreadable for weeks without refrigeration, spoilage or odors. Two-piece design features an inverted bell-shaped lid and crock base for serving butter at the table, while protecting and storing the butter after each use","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/317x+We8+6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Butter Bell","source_asin":"B000FBL3IC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000FBL3IC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000FBL3IC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":259267,"name":"Extra Thick Mattress Topper Fitted Mattress Pad Breathable Fluffy Soft Pillow Top Queen Size with 8-21\" Elastic Deep Pocket, Overfilled 7D Spiral Fibe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715kg1Ipk-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PREMIUM MATERIAL & FILLING】High-density weave and 120gms brushed microfiber fabric is exceptionally soft, breathable, comfortable, quick-dry, shrink-resistant and durable. Overfilled with Upgraded 7D spiral fiber filling, it's 50% thicker and softer than normal mattress pad and also provides stronger support to prevent backache. 【ULTRA THICK & MAXI COMFORT】With overfilled snow down alternative filling and even weight distribution which traps air that enables the mattress pad to breathe and help regulate temperature. No more sweaty nights caused by memory foam pads or traditional mattresses. This breathable mattress pad can improve your quality of sleep and leave you feeling well-rested when morning comes. 【DEEP POCKET & STURDY STITCHED SEAM】8\"-21\" elastic deep pocket will wrap your mattress perfectly so the pillow top will stay in place and you can toss and turn freely during the sleepy nights. Good tensile strength holds the stitched seam securely during machine wash. Don't worry about tearing and the fill poking out of the fabric. Bed topper is available in Twin: 39\"x 75\"+18\" Twin XL: 39\"x 80\"+18\" Full: 54\" x 75\"+18\" Queen: 60\"x80\"+18\" King: 78\"x 80\"+18\" CK: 72\"x 84\"+18\". 【MACHINE WASHABLE & EASY MAINTAIN】 MILDLY mattress protector is thicker enough to protect your expensive mattress. Also, it's easy to wash. Just wash in large capacity washing machine in cold water on a gentle cycle. Only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Low heat tumble dry. Do not iron. Compared with normal down filling, this 7D spiral fiber filling has a time-tested bounce and retains shape after consistent wash. Finally, it's foldable, easy to store and transport! 【100% CUSTOMER SATISFACTION】Certified STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX, MILDLY topper pad is tested to be safe from 300+ harmful chemicals. Rest assured, if you're not happy with our mattress toppers, write to us and we will resolve your query within 1 business day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715kg1Ipk-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MILDLY","source_asin":"B0B3T92MVX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3T92MVX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3T92MVX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
