window.products.push({"id":259279,"name":"Lervont Blackout Curtains for Bedroom - Grommet Thermal Insulated Room Darkening Curtains for Living Room, Set of 2 Panels (52 x 84 Inch, Navy Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mokNEwOmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Lervont Quality Curtains]: There are so many reasons to love Lervont Blackout Curtains. With a soft, luxurious drape, it brings both casual warmth and refined style to the room. The blackout lining provides maximum light control and privacy, all while preserving a minimalist appeal. Available in three classic palette. [Triple Weave Fabric]: Lervont blackout curtains are made of triple weaved fabric; the fabric is dense but very soft to the touch. It drapes effortlessly. Lervont blackout curtains are thicker and heavier than most of the other curtains: Navy blue color 52 x 84 inches 2 panels set weight: 4.40 lb. [Light Control]: Lervont navy blue color blackout curtains blocks 99% of the sunlight on average. In addition the curtain is UV resistant, thermal insulated, and acts as a barrier to noise. [Two Panels Included]: Each package includes a set of 2 panels, each 52 inch wide by 84 inch long.Each panel comes with 8 anti-rust metal grommets that are 1.6 inches in diameter. [Machine Washable]: Machine washable in gentle cycle and cold water. Do not bleach. Dry on low. Iron at low temperature if needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mokNEwOmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lervont","source_asin":"B091GDVNHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091GDVNHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091GDVNHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":259280,"name":"Onlycooker Whistling Tea Kettle Stainless Steel Stovetop Teakettle with Infuser Sturdy Teapot for Tea Coffee Fast Boiling Color Rainbow Mirror Finish ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HYpWrdPjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you still finding best-quality, best-performing tea kettle for your kitchen? Onlycooker stainless steel whistling kettle is perfect for you! This beautiful teapot is an elegant addition to any kitchen. Onlycooker stovetop whistling tea kettle is made of high quality stainless steel, oxidation resistance and corrosion resistance. Rest assured that the teapot keeps you away from heavy metals, just enjoy your tea time! Features: 1. This stove top kettle whistles when the water is boiling. Don't need a clock or timer to remind you, the special tone will take you back in time!  2. Onlycooker tea kettle works on ALL kitchen cooktops; electric, gas, ceramic and even works with most induction stove tops! Specification: - Material: Premium Food Grade Stainless Steel - Teakettle Size: 8\" x 5.5 \"(Diameter*Height) - Kettle Capacity: 2 L/2.1 Qt - Finish Type: Mirror Finish - Color: Silver Interior & Rainbow Coats (Titanium Metal Coats) - Package Content: 1 x Whistling Teakettle + 1 x Infuser. Note: 1. The kettle will whistle when boiling, this feature cannot be turned off. 2. Remove water and completely dry interior after use to avoid rust or mineral build up. 3. If mineral deposits are detected, boil water on medium heat for 15 min. with 1 oz. of lemon juice. Rinse and dry. 4. Make sure the water level below the Max. level line to ensure whistling. 5. No fill water over the Max lever line, overfilling teakettles can cause boiling water to be forced out of the spout, increasing burn risk. 6. Close the lid tightly to ensure a normal whistle. 7. Use on proper size of cooktop,and keep flame under bottom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HYpWrdPjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Onlycooker","source_asin":"B07BLVTGPQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BLVTGPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BLVTGPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
