window.products.push({"id":259308,"name":"DOWNFORT 2 Pack Goose Feather Quilted Pillows, Bed Pillows for Sleeping, Soft Fluffy Pillow, Support Pillows for Back, Side, Stomach Sleepers, Queen S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b5PRtAgVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FLUFFY AND SOFT：The pillow inserts have three layers of filling, the upper and lower layers are comfortable pearl wool, and the middle layer is 2 to 4 cm gray goose feather, giving you the softest sleep experience. Lying on the bed pillows for sleeping, your head is surrounded with feathers and you will enjoy the ultimate warmth. RIGHT AMOUNT SUPPORT: With two layers of pearl cotton support, our white pillows will not be too soft or firm. The neck support pillow will elastically frame the most appropriate support angle for your neck. You will have a nice night instead of tossing and turning in bed because the soft pillow are too low or too high. EXQUISITE SEWING CRAFT: The fabric of this fluffy pillow is 100% cotton, and needle punched cotton is used for multi needle quilting to ensure that goose down will not leak out of the body pillows. The fluffy pillow with the material of cotton is comfortable and breathable, soft against the skin, will give you the most sweet sleep. COMFORTABLE EXPERIENCE: With the queen bedding, you will feel as if you are in a five-star hotel. The feather pillow is soft and supportive, which can relax your whole body. Like hotel pillows, they fit your head without hanging your neck. Our firm pillow can help relieve like the side sleeper pillow for neck and shoulder pain, and let you sleep until dawn. CAREFUL VACUUM PACKING:The sleep pillow you received was vacuum-packed in order to keep it intact. Therefore, upon receipt of the goose feather pillow, we recommend that you leave the feather pillows in a ventilated environment for a few days to allow the pillows to regain its fluff after being squeezed in transit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b5PRtAgVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOWNFORT","source_asin":"B0BLNGV1QP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259308","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLNGV1QP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLNGV1QP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
