window.products.push({"id":259321,"name":"Butter Dish, Ceramic Butter Dish with Lid Knife, White Butter Dish with Handle Cover for Countertop, Double Silicone Seal Airtight Butter Keeper Conta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SjPuXx7iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BUTTER DISH with LID/KNIFE ： This SAIURE new oval design butter dish measures 7.25 x 3.75 x 3.15 inch, it’s larger than others and enough to hold 2 sticks butter. Oval shape is more beautiful, and no more butter stuck in right-angle. 100% SEALING BUTTER CROCK KEEPER：ceramic butter dish with bamboo lid and ceramic knife， uses the bamboo lid with double silicone loop, better sealing than one silicone loop, better preservation of butter and keep butter fresh longer. EASY CLEAN UP ： The butter dish with lid are made of high quality ceramic, it can be used in DISHWASHER, MIRCROWAVE, FREEZER, REFRIGERATOR and you can clean it easily hand wash. No Moldy Bamboo Lid : The butter dishes’ lid are made of bamboo, the bamboo are different with wooden, the wood is easily get mold with wet BUT the completely dry bamboo are not. The dry bamboo were coated with waterproof oil will not absorb any water and get moldy. WITH BUTTER CUTTER : No more purchase! The ceramic butter dish with lid and ceramic cutter, which were built into the lid. No more wasting searching for butter knife when you take the butter out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SjPuXx7iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAIURE","source_asin":"B0BPRNC4R3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259321","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPRNC4R3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPRNC4R3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
