window.products.push({"id":259339,"name":"HOSKO 1 Inch Black Curtain Rod, Curtain Rods for Windows 30 to 60 inches with Two Curtain Rods Brackets, Heavy Duty Metal Drapery Rod for Bedroom, Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WYXr8uHDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Adjustable Length: Customize Your Window Treatments】Introducing our Adjustable Window Curtain Rods, the perfect solution for your home's window treatments. Easily adjust the length of the rod from 30 to 60 inches by splicing different numbers of rods, with each section measuring approximately 15 inches. 【Durable and Heavy-Duty: Sturdy Support for Your Curtains】Made of durable and heavy-duty 1-inch metal, these curtain rods can support curtains up to 30 lbs, making them perfect for a wide range of curtains on the market, including grommet, back panel, and top panel curtains. 【Simple and Stylish Design: Complements Any Room Decor】Our black curtain rods feature a simple and stylish design with a minimalist look that complements any decor style and room in your home, including the bedroom, living room, kitchen, dining room, and bathroom. 【All-Inclusive Package: Easy and Convenient Installation】The 30 to 60-inch curtain rod set comes with two mounting brackets, four screws, four drywall anchors, and eight plastic curtain rings designed for use with grommet curtain rods to reduce noise when sliding. Installation instructions are also included. 【100% Customer Satisfaction: Our Guarantee to You】We stand behind the quality of our product, and our window curtain rods come with a 5-year limited maintenance or replacement warranty. Our top priority is 100% customer satisfaction, so please feel free to contact us with any questions or concerns. Order now and enjoy a beautiful and functional window treatment solution!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WYXr8uHDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOSKO","source_asin":"B09PTNDNFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259339","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PTNDNFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PTNDNFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":259340,"name":"Blessed Is She Who Has Believed - Luke 1:45 Bible Scripture Quote - FRAMED - Home Decor Desk Stand and Wall Art, Black Wood Frame, White, 7x9","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.13,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OwUUjwyhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This beautiful wall art is a perfect way to add a touch of inspiration and encouragement to any room in your home. The piece features the Bible quote from Luke 1:45, \"Blessed is she who has believed that the Lord would fulfill his promises to her,\" which serves as a powerful reminder of the strength and faith that comes from trusting in God's promises. The quote from Luke 1:45 featured in this wall art is a powerful testament to the importance of faith and trust in God's promises. In the passage, Mary's cousin Elizabeth greets her with the words, \"Blessed is she who has believed that the Lord would fulfill his promises to her.\" Mary had just been visited by an angel and told that she would conceive a child, even though she was a virgin. Despite the seeming impossibility of this task, Mary chose to trust in God's promises and was ultimately blessed beyond measure. This quote reminds us that, like Mary, we too can find blessings and strength when we choose to believe in God's promises and put our faith in His plan for our lives. The design of the wall art is shabby chic, with a wood plaque-like background that gives the piece a rustic and timeless feel. The soft, muted colors and vintage style make it a versatile piece that will complement a wide range of decor styles. Whether you are looking to add a touch of inspiration to your own home or looking for a thoughtful gift for a loved one, this wall art is a beautiful and meaningful choice. It can be hung in a variety of spaces, from a living room to a bedroom to a home office, and will serve as a daily reminder of the power of faith and the blessings that come from trusting in God. Overall, this wall art is a beautiful and inspiring piece that will bring a touch of warmth and comfort to any space. With its shabby chic style and powerful Bible quote, it is a perfect addition to any home and a thoughtful way to show your love and appreciation for the people in your life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OwUUjwyhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art Hub","source_asin":"B07P31YM2P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P31YM2P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P31YM2P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
