window.products.push({"id":259479,"name":"Purple Leather Matador 4'x6' Rug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91prL4UwCtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Durable as they are striking in design, the Matador Collection of Leather rugs are meticulously made by hand-weaving leather strips as the weft of the rug and a fine cotton strand as the warp, resulting in a beautiful, rustic texture and interesting natural braided pattern. Add the smell and feel of real leather to any room with this purple hand woven leather rug. Made of soft leather interwoven with a cotton foundation, this rugged rug makes sense ecologically, aesthetically, and economically. Hand made in villages of North Central India, this purple leather rug has slight accents of lighter shades of purple throughout the rug. An elegant complement to any décor, this leather rug is completely reversible and extremely durable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91prL4UwCtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Matador","source_asin":"B004PHYSDE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259479","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004PHYSDE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004PHYSDE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":259480,"name":"Painted Fish Flocked Blacklight Poster - Flocked - 23\" x 35\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TS-WR-sRL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Painted Fish Blacklight Poster , 23 inches x 35 inches, standard sized. This poster image features multi-color fish including clownfish, angelfish, and seahorses. You'll feel like you're in a school of fish when looking at this poster.Printed in the USA with highly fluorescent inks and black flocking. Blacklight posters make great decoration for bedrooms, college dorm rooms, parties, entertainment rooms, or wherever you need a splash of color or glow.A flocked poster has black fibers that feel felt-like. The black appears much darker than an ink with no glare and gives great contrast to the fluorescent UV reactive inks. The poster has a 3/4 inch (1.9 cm white border around the whole poster, which is normal for screen printed blacklight posters. The posters get pulled through the printing press by this border and the area cannot be printed.Blacklight not included and is required to see the poster fluoresce or glow in the dark. Image under blacklight is for reference only, results may vary depending on type of blacklight (ultraviolet fixture or bulb) used.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TS-WR-sRL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scorpio Posters","source_asin":"B07WPWF2DY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259480","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WPWF2DY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WPWF2DY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":259481,"name":"MIFXIN Tub Chair Slipcover 2-Piece Velvet Barrel Club Chair Covers with Cushion Cover Stretchy Soft Washable Armchair Sofa Couch Furniture Protector f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mi4w7VicS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Have you been looking for a way to keep your tub chair protected from damage? Would you like to hide the edges of wear, spils, stains and worn of the armchair? MIFXIN 2-Piece Velvet Club Chair Slipcover are appropriate good choice. Club chair slipcovers can not only give people elegant and stylish feeling, but also prevent damage and make your old club chairs look elegant and new! It is a convenient way to promote happiness without a big expense, perfect for families with children and pets. Solid Color with luxurious velvet stretch polyester fabric, look rich and elegant. Very comfortable and soft to sit. Your familiy will much love it! Size (approx.) Tub Chair Height: 65-72cm/25.6-28.3inch Tub Chair Length: 65-75cm/25.6-29.5inch Tub Chair Width: 55-65cm/21.6-25.6inch Cushion Length: 45-52cm/17.7-20.5inch Cushion Width: 50-55cm/19.7-21.6inch How to install? Step 1: Remove the set cushion. Step 2: Place the slipcover around the top of the chair. Step 3: Drape the slipcover over the entire tub chair. Step 4: Adjust the all fabric to line up the seams of the black and armrest. Step 5: Cover the separated seat cushions by elastic strap all round. Step 6: Put the covered seat cushions back. Weight: about 650g Package include: 1 x Club Chair Base Cover 1 x Seat Cushion Cover Note: 1. We recommend that you buy a chair cover that is slightly larger than your chair due to a deviation of about 2-3 cm. 2. Because slipcover is elastic, do not iron. If ironed, will lose some elsticity. 3. Due to different screen displays, the color of the product may be a bit different from the picture.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mi4w7VicS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIFXIN","source_asin":"B0974DCB9J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0974DCB9J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0974DCB9J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
