window.products.push({"id":259616,"name":"komax OvenGlass Oven Safe Glass Storage Containers Set and Sleek Design Perfect for Storing Food and Liquids (Round,3 sizes 32.1 oz,20.9 oz and 13.5 o","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b8isB2-qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KOMAX OVEN GLASS Food Containers   Komax Oven glass storage container can be used with oven and microwave with very high heat resistance. It is useful not only for storage but also for cooking.  Especially this glass storage is discoloration free, easily washable, and highly transparent.  This has non-lug lid design maximizes space efficiency of fridge. Also it provides perfect stack-ability which ensures safety of kitchen especially in moving from kitchen table to fridge and the vice versa.   Characteristics of Komax oven glass design are;  1. 2 libs of lid provide perfect stacking.  2. No lug of lid provides smooth surface after locking.  3. Hole of hinges provides upgraded rigidness as well as sleek design.  This is something you will have for many years. These are very high quality, the best you've owned. When compared to other glass containers out there, these Oven Glass containers are made of a heavier-duty glass, with a better finish.  Equally important, these Oven Glass containers are leak-proof, with four tight snapping/locking handles on each container (even the small ones). The lids on the other containers are fairly secure, but some of them do allow leaks, but with Komax Oven glass storage containers you could trust them for carrying to and from the oven and fridge without leaking.   It's 100% Air tight it won't spill your liquids ever, and the freshness in those delicate ingredients such as fruits or vegetables will be greatly increased when stored inside Oven Glass!, meaning you'll save money and won't throw away as much leftovers as you used to.  Oven Glass containers are perfectly safe for,Oven, Microwave, Freezer & Dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b8isB2-qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Komax","source_asin":"B00MWAG226","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MWAG226","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MWAG226","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
