window.products.push({"id":259661,"name":"Wearable Blanket Hoodie, Oversized Sweatshirt Adult with Sleeves and Folding Giant Pocket, Warm and Cozy Big Sherpa Flannel Hoodie for Women and Men -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pWn078dfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FEELS LIKE A PROTABLE ELECTRIC BLANKET: Immerse yourself in the luxurious comfort of a blanket hoodie this season.The perfect loungewear, cover yourself with comfort as you relax around your home. Tuck your legs into the blanket sweater to feel like a cocoon as you enjoy the TV or curl up in your bed as you read your new book with a mug of hot chocolate at your side. THOUGHTFUL DESIGN DETAILS: The marsupial pocket—with its giant size and unique shape—keeps your hands warm and can store all your essentials. (Snacks, phone, pets—you name it!). Not just limited to indoors, you can take your oversized hoodie blanket out into the wild too. Equipped with a hood to protect you from the elements, many of our customers have enjoyed the warmth of their hoodie on camping trips and trips to the market. EXTREME COMFORT & LUXURY MATERIAL: Wearable blanket offers different senses of softness with one side of smooth flannel and fluffy sherpa to the other - Experience the delicate fabric against your skin as you keep yourself nice and toasty. -Ultra-plush sunggie provides better fade & stain resistance than cotton ones - Crafted with the greatest quality of 100% microfiber fabric all layers for durable use - Perfect for folks who are sensitive to natural fibers. KEEP WARM AND COZY: This oversized hoodie combines the warmth of a warm blanket with the comfort of your favorite sweatshirt. It’s incredibly soft and will quickly become your favorite. This blanket is one size fits all to keep you cozy and warm from head to toe. Whether you are relaxing on the couch, running errands, or outside cheering on your favorite team, the hoody blanket will keep you warm and toasty. FEATURES & CARE- WASH:Washing? Easy! Machine washable giant blanket in cold water with similar colors, tumble dry on low heat, no ironing or expensive cleaning required! Just toss in the wash on cold then tumble dry separately on low - it comes out like new!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pWn078dfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aaalenig","source_asin":"B09DXDTD2X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DXDTD2X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DXDTD2X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
