window.products.push({"id":259778,"name":"Deconovo Stretch Strapless Sofa Cover Solid Color Premium Jacquard Smooth Grey Couch Cover for 3 Cushion Sofa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qOzrN1jSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stretch Elastic Sofa Slipcover Collection by Deconovo Deconovo Jacquard Woven Stretch Elastic Fabric Sofa Cover Dress up, protect, and refresh your old sofa or leather living room couch with these beautifully stretched Deconovo Velvet Sofa Slipcover. Each of these stretch slipcovers is crafted from a machine-washable polyester and spandex blend, making them easy to care for. Features a soft, form-fitting textured stretching fabric that is durable and resistant, fitting snugly over your couch for a sleek look. With an attractive sense of touch of soft velvet plush, available in a variety of appealing colors, the cover complements any space with refined elegance. This Deconovo stretch sofa cover is easy to install and refresh the look of your sofa and update your living room in an instant. You simply won't believe it's a slipcover, and now in a short sofa makeup! Measuring Tips To ensure a better fit, please measure before purchasing. You could measure the width of your sofa back the first thing we recommend you to do is to measure the width of your sofa back. Once you know the width of your sofa back, you can start to choose the suitable slipcover for your sofa. The instructions are as follows: Chair covers fit the back of sofa chair from 32\" to 47\" wide. Chair covers fit the back of sofa chair from 32\" to 47\" wide. Recliner cover fit the back of recliner from 40\" to 45\" wide Recliner cover fit the back of recliner from 40\" to 45\" wide Loveseat covers fit the back of furniture from 57\" to 70\" wide. Loveseat covers fit the back of furniture from 57\" to 70\" wide. Sofa covers fit the back of sofa from 72\" to 85\" wide. Sofa covers fit the back of sofa from 72\" to 85\" wide. Care Instructions: These polyester curtains are made to last requiring minimum caring. Machine washable, wash below 86F. Gentle cycle, do not bleach, tumble dry low, no ironing. These polyester curtains are made to last requiring minimum caring. Machine washable, wash below 86F. Gentle cycle, do not bleach, tumble dry low, no ironing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qOzrN1jSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deconovo","source_asin":"B07DNY5YKC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259778","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DNY5YKC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DNY5YKC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":259779,"name":"Exotic Pakkawood 6-Piece Kitchen Utensil Set with 12-in Spoon, 12-in Slotted Spoon, 12-in Spatula, 12-in Corner Spoon, 13-in Large Spurtle, Double Mea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91crEVblQRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beautify Your Kitchen with Exotic Wood - Replace your boring plain black utensils with colorful & exotic pakkawood to spice up your space and bring new life to your kitchen. Our pakkawood is made from layers of premium hardwood and infused with chemical-free, 100% natural food grade dyes to create colorful patterns and shapes. Due to the handmade nature of our products, there may be slight variations in color and/or craftsmanship. Scratch-Proof & Safe on Non-Stick Cookware - Crate Collective pakkawood wooden utensil sets are fully nonstick and highly resistant against stains and wilting. These wooden spoons will not leave scratches on your cookware, including stainless steel, ceramic, and cast iron pots and pans. Lightweight, yet durable and gentle, these beautifully designed kitchen tools get the job done in style. 6-Piece Set - This 6-piece set includes everything you'll need for cooking all types of meals. The 12\" Spoon & Slotted Spoon are great for stirring, serving, and draining soups and pastas. The 12\" Corner spoon is perfect for scraping hard-to-reach areas in your pots or baking dishes. The 12\" Straight-Edge Spatula works well for sautéing, flipping, and serving. The 9\" measuring spoon is perfect for ensuring you have just the right amount of spice in your meals. Earth-Friendly & Good for the Environment - Kick your plastic spoons & spatulas to the curb and invest in a product that's good for the earth! Unlike traditional cookware tools, pakkawood is chemical free, meaning it's good for you and the planet. No need to worry about melting or burning plastics into your food. Comes Clean in Seconds - These non-stick utensils are easy to clean and maintain, taking the hassle out of kitchen cleanup. Hand wash with warm water and soap and towel dry for best results. *We do not recommend soaking for long periods of time, as prolonged exposure to water can damage wood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91crEVblQRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crate Collective","source_asin":"B08DHQBXMR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259779","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DHQBXMR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DHQBXMR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":259780,"name":"Bell'O 48\" Enterprise Desk with Speakers & Charging Station - Black, ODS4915-NB03","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Wi5pNouaL._AC_.jpg","description":"Modernize your home office with the Enterprise desk, equipped with integrated Bluetooth speakers, a charging station for your devices, and concealed storage. Sleek with a black finish, sliver legs and a smoked glass top and cabinet door, this piece is perfect for the modern or contemporary home. A touch latch drawer and side cabinet with a touch latch door conceal all your office supplies. The drawer includes a removable pencil tray while the cabinet includes a deep file drawer for organizing hanging folders. The integrated speakers in the hutch top allow you to wirelessly stream audio from any Bluetooth enabled device anywhere in the room and connect a device to listen to audio. Charge up all your devices with the two-outlet, two-USB charging station also located on the hutch top.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Wi5pNouaL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bell'O","source_asin":"B08F9FM8W3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259780","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F9FM8W3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F9FM8W3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
