window.products.push({"id":259791,"name":"Coffee Mug Warmer, 70W Coffee Cup Warmer with 3-Temps Settings(130~170°F), Auto Shut Off and Timing Function,USB Coffee Warmer with Phone Charger Desk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EqhrLM6JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"30-70W FAST HEATING MUG WARMER- Are you still bothered by the coffee growing cold? Unlike other 18 Watt coffee warmer just keep coffee lukewarm, our usb cup warmer can heat coffee/milk/tea rapidly and keep it really hot. And with temperature control settings, you can adjust the temperature with the touch button to keep the coffee temperature at 130°F/150°F/170°F. Coffee lovers shouldn’t miss this wonderful warmer. USB PHONE CHARGING FUNCTION- The USB mug warmer with 2 type-c port and 1 USB charging port, can not only can warm your drinks, but charge your phones (Applicable to iPhone cable). You don’t need to buy extra chargers to charge your phone. What’s more, it also can used as candle warmer, save your expenses, make your life more warm and convenient. GRAVITY AUTO OFF &TIMING SETTINGS- This mug warmer for desk built- in gravity induction switch, put the coffee cups on warmer, it will auto work, take away the mug, it will stop heating. Besides,our coffee warmer for desk with timing settings, you can set the desired heating time for the coffee for 2h/4h/8h. If not set, it will auto turn off after 8 hours of work, so you don't have to worry about forgetting to turn it off, prevent any potential safety hazards. Perfectly use in office or at home. FIT MOST COFFEE MUGS- Our electric coffee cup warmer heating zone made of aluminum alloy, has excellent thermal conductivity for cups made of metal, enamel, ceramic, glassware, etc (thin-walled, flat-bottomed mugs will have the best warming properties). And high temperature resistance, not easy to scratch, waterproof and easy to clean. NOT suit for plastic cups, paper cups, and thermos cups. WARMEST & PRACTICAL GIFT- Lightweight coffee mug warmer heater is easy to carry and take anywhere, 59in UL power cord more convenient. Retro and beautiful design will be the ideal gift to show your care and warm to your families, lover, friends on Thanksgiving, Birthday, Anniversary, Valentine, Christmas, New Years, Housewarming.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EqhrLM6JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KKSEVENS","source_asin":"B0BHWDKZ6D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259791","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHWDKZ6D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHWDKZ6D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
