window.products.push({"id":259805,"name":"TomCare 2-Tier Fruit Basket Metal Fruit Bowl Bread Baskets Detachable Fruit Holder Kitchen Storage Baskets Stand - Screws Free Design for Fruits Bread","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bOvO4YgbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Detachable 2-Tier Basket: It can be separated into 2 baskets. If you don't want to stack the baskets like a shelf unit, you can use them individually as they do have circular feet that provide a balanced level support. So you can keep bread in one area, and fruit in another. No Screws Needed: Screw free installation design, just let the arms hold the baskets, which will help save much time. Nice glossy black finish, well made and very attractive for the kitchen, bathroom or really anywhere! Stable Structure: Constructed from thickened metal frame with black powder coated finish, this fruit basket is really strong with a good weight bearing capacity. Each basket features four circular stand base support, which is very stable and non-slip on countertop or cabinet. Perfect Size: Total height: 15.35 inch; Top basket size: 10.6 x 7.3 x 4 inch; Bottom basket size: 11.7 x 7.5 x 4 inch. This two-tiered basket is a great size for storing fruits, breads, vegetables and snacks. Also, it fits perfectly on counter or cabinet in your kitchen or bathroom. Large Capacity: This fruit storage doesn't take up too much space and it hold quite a lot. If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bOvO4YgbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TomCare","source_asin":"B091TMVC1K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091TMVC1K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091TMVC1K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":259806,"name":"OR209 Ornament 4 inch Dream Catcher Glass Crystal Beaded Christmas Fair Trade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Lg3sbb36L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"One (1) dream catcher tree ornament 4 x 7 hand made assortment glass beads and crystal. One unique dream catcher ships with your order from our variety. Dream Catchers are an ancient spiritual tool used to help assure good dreams to those that sleep under them. A dream catcher is usually placed over a place you would sleep where the morning light can hit it. As you sleep all dreams from the spirit world have to pass through the dream catcher.Only good dreams can pass through the hole in the center while the bad dreams are caught in the webbing and are destroyed by the morning light.A wonderful dream catcher 4 inches in diameter made of glass beads by artisans in Santiago de Atitlan, Guatemala.Priced directly from the artisan at $ 9.99 Made in the Guatemala fairly traded by artisans in Santiago de Atitlan.Dream catchers have been apart of Native American Indian culture for centuries. Many Native tribes would fashion a woven web or use an old net or snare as the center of the catcher. They would the decorate the webbed center with sacred items such as feathers, hides and beads. The belief is said these sacred items would attract good spirits and the web would Catch bad spirits preventing them from effecting you both in your sleep and beyond. These dream catcher are made in the tradition of the originals. Each center hoop is decorated with very fine glass and crystal beads which has a woven web center. Each dream catcher is then decorated with fine quality decorative bead dangles that hang below the symbolic web. Hang our dream catchers from above your bed or anywhere to promote good spirituality and to prevent bad spirits from coming your way! Each dream catcher features a 4 web and measures nearly 10 top to bottom! Color ships assorted. Very limited production- Compare at $ 19.95 each","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Lg3sbb36L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unknown","source_asin":"B01MUWMS57","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259806","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MUWMS57","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MUWMS57","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
