window.products.push({"id":259893,"name":"ironMATIK 7-Layer Ironing Mat & 9-Layer Steam Glove Set | Heat Reflective & Furniture Protector | Portable, Easy to Store & for Travel | Made in Europ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":94.35,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ebY6B7VPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REFLECT HEAT & PROTECT FURNITURE: the new 7-Layer ironMATIK Ironing Mats / Blankets use patented technology and extra padding to reflect heat, cutting your ironing time in half. Unlike wool mats and felt pads, the ultimate furniture protector will not leave black marks on your iron. PROTECT YOUR HAND: the 9-Layer ironMATIK Steam / Ironing Gloves are made to protect your hand when you are steaming your clothes on the go. A supreme tool for small ironing projects which you can do in the palm of your hand. IRONING MAT & STEAM MAT in ONE: the mat can be used to iron / press on any flat surface, including kitchen and cabinet counter top; dining room table; over your washing machine or dryer in your laundry room; or hanging over the door or against the wall. Use with a Cricut, standard or steam iron, or a handheld steamer. GENEROUS SIZE: the handy mat is big and measures 39 by 25 inches, which means it is large and wide enough to iron clothes, linens, fabric, pillow cases. The non-slip silicone backing is designed to grip and is free of magnetic attachments! It is light, foldable and will replace mini or heavy duty ironing boards, and is a perfect pad to have next to your sewing machine and to travel with. Great for quilters, newlyweds, new moms, and the elderly. DESIGNED IN USA & MADE IN EUROPE: the folding ironing mat & steam glove bundle from ironMATIK comes in 5 gorgeous colors and is designed in the USA and made in Europe using high quality materials and strict labor standards! The fabric patterns were inspired from the pink city of Jaipur and illustrated by Janine Lecour, a surface designer from Atlanta, GA. LAUNCH GIFT: For a limited time only, our bundles come with a gift of two fat quarters (22 by 18 inches).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ebY6B7VPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ironmatik","source_asin":"B0BFMQS9J6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-259893","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFMQS9J6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFMQS9J6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
